# Licensed BADA 3 transactional MOVE and creation gate.
# Run only after pybada3-envelope-flight passes.
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === BADA 3 DIRECT STATE TRANSACTION GATE ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO Runtime model bounds decide every result, and generated evidence is ignored.
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT REPORT accepts MOVE, ENFORCE rolls MOVE back, and infeasible CRE is rejected.
00:00:00.15>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.20>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.25>PERFMODEL BADA3
00:00:00.30>DT 0.05
00:00:00.35>DATE 11,8,2026,12:00:00
00:00:01.00>CRE B3DR,A320,41.30,2.10,90,FL100,250
00:00:01.10>CRE B3DE,A320,41.32,2.10,90,FL100,250
00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS B3DR TEM
00:00:01.25>DYNAMICS B3DE TEM
00:00:01.30>ENVELOPECHECKS B3DR CUSTOM ALTITUDE_MAX
00:00:01.35>ENVELOPECHECKS B3DE CUSTOM ALTITUDE_MAX
00:00:01.40>ENVELOPE B3DR REPORT
00:00:01.45>ENVELOPE B3DE ENFORCE
00:00:02.00>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada3-envelope-direct.csv
00:00:03.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Applying the same excessive direct altitude to REPORT and ENFORCE.
00:00:03.10>MOVE B3DR,41.50,2.50,FL450,90,250
00:00:03.20>MOVE B3DE,41.52,2.50,FL450,90,250
00:00:04.00>PERFSTATUS B3DR ALL
00:00:04.10>PERFSTATUS B3DE ALL
00:00:05.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Testing transactional creation under a temporary ENFORCE default.
00:00:05.10>ENVELOPE ENFORCE
00:00:05.20>CRE B3BAD,A320,41.34,2.10,90,FL100,600
00:00:05.30>ENVELOPE OFF
00:00:06.00>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:00:06.10>ECHO TEST INFO Run validate_bada3_flight.py with --direct on the direct CSV.
00:00:06.20>ECHO TEST EXPECT B3DR is infeasible, B3DE preserves its complete prior state, and B3BAD is absent.
00:00:07.00>HOLD
